Hence we have on the one hand

\[\langle A^{-1}f,f\rangle\leqslant(1/\!\gamma)\,\|\,f\,\|_{\star}^{2}.\]

On the other hand, we set

\[K=\|\,A\,\|_{\mathscr{L}(X;X)}.\]

Therefore

\[\|\,f\,\|_{\star}\leqslant K\,\|\,A^{-1}f\,\|_{X}\]

and thus

\[\langle A^{-1}f,f\rangle\geqslant(\gamma/K^{2})\,\|\,f\,\|_{\star}^{2}.\]

Summing up, we get

\[(\gamma/K^{2})\,\|\,f\,\|_{\star}^{2}\leqslant\langle A^{-1}f,f\rangle \leqslant(1/\!\gamma)\,\|\,f\,\|_{\star}^{2}.\qed\] (6.26)

